{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060024/block/singleImage/3247044/df/01M5M571ZRF88KNNCWPFF9J988.jpeg?updatedAt=1792751836\"/><figcaption>Grand YOHO五房複式戶7.5萬元新高價租出。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，租盤需求持續增加，惟盤源供應不足，租金續創新高。元朗Grand YOHO第3座頂層複式戶，單位實用面積約2,038方呎，五房間隔，包括3個套房，附連天台及泳池，新近以月租7.5萬元租出，呎租約36.8元，租金創屋苑及元朗市中心新高。 王勤學指，業主於2023年以4,450萬元買入單位，現享約2厘租金回報。 資料顯示，Grand YOHO位於元朗朗日路9號，毗鄰港鐵元朗站，2016年入伙，分為2期共有7座，提供1,954個單位。 即睇元朗Grand YOHO租盤(House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:42:08.571027+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T16:58:13.769843+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:37:44.783973+00:00","content_hash":"89c6fbe359004a3f8b88f02ade89b021f470efefd9307e0e4b98bb59d8d1d02d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}